      en: ["Kirtipur was founded in the 12th century, around 1199 CE.", "The city is located about 5 km southwest of Kathmandu.", "Population: approximately 50,000 as of 2021.", "The Bag Bhairab Temple was built in 1560 CE.", "Kirtipur covers an area of 4.8 square kilometers.", "The 1768 siege lasted several months, with heavy casualties."],
      es: ["Fundada en el siglo XII por Shiva Deva", "Altitud de unos 1.400 metros", "Templo Bag Bhairab de 1560 d.C.", "Cerca de 50.000 habitantes (2021)", "Superficie de 4,8 km²", "Sitio de varios meses en 1768"],
      pt: ["Fundada no século XII pelo rei Shiva Deva", "Altitude de cerca de 1.400 metros", "Templo Bag Bhairab data de 1560 d.C.", "População de cerca de 50.000 (2021)", "Área da cidade de cerca de 4,8 km²", "O cerco de Shah durou vários meses em 1768"],
