      en: ["The site dates back to the 12th century.", "It was built during the reign of the Khasa Malla kings.", "The temple is constructed in the Shikhara stone style.", "Modern reconstruction and excavation started in 2000.", "The site features both Hindu and Buddhist carvings.", "It is located in the Surkhet Valley of western Nepal."],
